## Deploy map (which URL proves what)

| URL | Branch | Meaning |
|-----|--------|---------|
| https://bananasutra.com | `main` | Live users |
| https://stage.bananasutra.com | `r50-overhaul` | Redesign integration |
| (none) | `staging` | Git integration only — not a public site |
| `*.bananasutra-redesign.pages.dev` | feat preview / `r50-overhaul` | Cloudflare Pages |

**seo-worker:** do not route `stage.bananasutra.com` through seo-worker.

---

## When in doubt

1. State which track you believe applies and why.
2. Name source branch, target branch, and URL you expect to change.
3. Ask Banana before merging or pushing to `main`, `staging`, or `r50-overhaul`.
